  "edits": [
    {
      "id": "A25471-zh-00001",
      "text": "■《智慧城市建设及产业振兴等相关法律施行规则》〔附页第7号格式〕<2021年7月12日修订>",
      "source_hash": "ba4698902d93f5af7ec12ef0d418cba9ecb18605c3ca669807eb28d41bffd4a3",
      "target_id": "XML:1802958"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25471-zh-00002",
      "text": "[ ] 智慧创新事业",
      "source_hash": "e4b6c2bae4c5c1b1984fd53300838d75995dc14098b6b7dc02621f3cc9021b24",
      "target_id": "XML:1802959"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25471-zh-00003",
      "text": "延期确认书",
      "source_hash": "8f703d3d562e2bdb8fc322f94045df440794c60d38a8ac56bf76aff9f213c0fe",
      "target_id": "XML:1802960"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25471-zh-00004",
      "text": "[ ] 智慧实证事业",
      "source_hash": "7a0b9bef1f76ba0d4ac192b1bf7ccb617b105e598dc5c034283cb5fc1b200bca",
      "target_id": "XML:1802961"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25471-zh-00007",
      "text": "实施期间延期批准日期",
      "source_hash": "d1f0572d3dccc3d6836dbc9e5369b441e31427f7c163a340075d7070cfa63d3d",
      "target_id": "XML:1802965"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25471-zh-00009",
      "text": "法人名称（姓名）",
      "source_hash": "9444b0a00a812f655b27d369eb4c26c19b67484b28bc7411ca01f82e11d76532",
      "target_id": "XML:1802967"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25471-zh-00016",
      "text": "主要内容",
      "source_hash": "55fa9f20eb47cc9f9fe2ca2fc9f80c7019fceed7ed10fb6567a7f997c1f14f7b",
      "target_id": "XML:1802974"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25471-zh-00017",
      "text": "实施期间／实证期间（原定）",
      "source_hash": "3564418ca6127cad5b18fc39e0567cf3e5803531e85dea1870655556439f842b",
      "target_id": "XML:1802975"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25471-zh-00018",
      "text": "（变更后）",
      "source_hash": "5f7e3c14c84baf005e312b14f7777a6ef8421744b9d60495bca6119fbd2ff302",
      "target_id": "XML:1802976"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25471-zh-00019",
      "text": "适用规制特例及规制改善的对象法律法规",
      "source_hash": "085bbf8840b5bd20723df5fabce60dd5b8b6f9c387e0d30624a1e9f6a8ca316c",
      "target_id": "XML:1802977"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25471-zh-00020",
      "text": "实施地区",
      "source_hash": "346942363717a71392645e0800f71648288e74afc376e473e6350381fef9c8f8",
      "target_id": "XML:1802978"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25471-zh-00021",
      "text": "特例条件",
      "source_hash": "177c9759b162af824022de6bb975a2c5fb3326a52e03b10ec748379b3af5698f",
      "target_id": "XML:1802979"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25471-zh-00022",
      "text": "※ 依据《智慧城市建设及产业振兴等相关法律》第四十九条第八款，国土交通部长官为确保环境、安全、卫生等",
      "source_hash": "e6c754cf33d9f359df7b25eef2bc22a6729f598f46c275e09a52c6c771528ae7",
      "target_id": "XML:1802980"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25471-zh-00023",
      "text": "而附加条件时，应填写该等条件。",
      "source_hash": "fe14dff0bfd6241a58181d7bd79d9bcb6eb01719d2535c62c7be9134269ef11e",
      "target_id": "XML:1802981"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25471-zh-00024",
      "text": "依据《智慧城市建设及产业振兴等相关法律》第五十一条第二款正文、第五十三条之三第一款及该法施行令第五十四条",
      "source_hash": "bc81933bbce3074f732413ef738a9c5cdd7ca5395df93ea43d5c1512f4e664e0",
      "target_id": "XML:1802982"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25471-zh-00025",
      "text": "第四款、该法施行规则第五条第二款，现按上述内容签发[ ]",
      "source_hash": "021121bc312b0b866fdd4b6b2449b0415f3f7cd61d8ba4d8aa5fbdd31de71871",
      "target_id": "XML:1802983"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25471-zh-00026",
      "text": "智慧创新事业 [ ]",
      "source_hash": "62ee9a8cce92e5f57d502b9c27547d49eb477a95b2c77b6067f044b2aa948940",
      "target_id": "XML:1802984"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25471-zh-00027",
      "text": "智慧实证事业实施期间或",
      "source_hash": "5413a0f8f3385c4a7715f8d8dea868db66613bbdd672d5d0328d90c04308feb2",
      "target_id": "XML:1802985"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25471-zh-00028",
      "text": "实证期间延期确认书。",
      "source_hash": "140a0a1955095e0eaf10fa1b87a340301b4243b545b6bdcb523a4ad1f4e39e0b",
      "target_id": "XML:1802986"
    }
